<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 PETRO</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pe</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petro</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Petro</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETRO</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ OLI MOA</para>
  <para style="ip">Silwano (Silas) yeɛ <char style="bd">Somafoɛ Petro</char> maa ɔhworɔle ye ngrataa nyɔ namu ɔ. Ná ɔkɔyɛ kyɛ Silwano he ala yeɛ né ɔne ye nate ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petro hworɔle krataa he mane Kristofoɛ bɔ basra bɛ, bɔ né bɛwɔ Ponto, Galatia, Kapadokia, Asia, ne Bitinia ne kɔyɛ afoɛ 62-64 Y.A.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né Somafoɛ ne wɔ Babilon. Né sɔ Kristofoɛ nemɔ yia ɔtaeɛ paa. Yeti, Petro nate krataa he aso hyɛle bɛ nguraen kyɛ bɛhɔ so bɛtira gyidie bɔ bɛle ye nanu. Petro maa bɛnwuni kyɛ, Nyameɛ nate Kristo bɔ otingyele ye naso awo bɛ foforɛ, yeti sɛ bɛkɔ so bɛdi nahorɛ a, bekonya agyapadeɛ bɔ ɔmborɔ wɔ anwuro.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɛhene la ahameɛ a, Petro sa hyɛle bɛ nguraen kyɛ bɛbɔ bɛ bra kyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛte Kristo deɛ ne.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bawo bɛ foforɛ bahɔ anidasoɛ bɔ ngoa wɔ nu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔhyɛle bɛ nguraen kyɛ bɛbɔ abrabɔ krongron (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:10">1:13–2:10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɔ odikyɛ Kristofoɛ yɛ mmerɛ bɔ beyia ɔhaw (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2:11–4:19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase; ɔsom adwuma ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Petro, bɔ nde Yesu Kristo somafoɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">metworɔ krataa he mebrɛ ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ abɔ bapete Ponto, Galatia, Kapadokia, Asia, ne Bitinia ne. Ɛmɔ bɔ baye ɛmɔ, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ bɔle ye ti anu ne. Ɔfale honhom krongron ne tele ɛmɔ nwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ kɔyɛ sotie bɛkɔma Yesu Kristo, na wafa ye mogya ne wapete ɛmɔ nwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Adom ne asomdwie ha ɛmɔ ma obu so.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ayɛyie ha Nyameɛ, y'Awurade Kristo Yesu Baba ne. Ye anwunvoin ti, otingyele Yesu fili ewue nu, na ɔnate so awo yɛ foforɛ maa yanya anidasoɛ bɔ ngoa wɔ nu, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />wamaa yanya agyapadeɛ bɔ ɔmborɔ, ɛfiɛ nne ye nwo, na ɔnzɛkye. Wafa sɔ anidasoɛ ne wasie anwuro wama ɛmɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Ɛmɔ gyidie ti, Nyameɛ fa ye tumi bɔ ɛmɔ nwo waen, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ konya ngoa bɔ bɛbaala ye ali wɔ awieɛ mmerɛ nanu ne. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ ɛmɔdi ahurusi ne, ɔwɔ nu, kesaalae de ɔhaw bɔ ɛmɔyia ne maa ɛmɔ wora bɔ, nakoso sɔ ala yeɛ odikyɛ ɔba ɔ, <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a kyẽa bɔ Yesu Kristo kɔla ye nwo ali ne, ɛmɔ gyidie bɔ basɔ banea ne kɔfa nidie, anuonyam, ne ayɛyie kɔwa; sɔ gyidie ne sombo tra sikaa kɔkorɛ bɔ bɛ afa bafa see nu po. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Ɔwɔ nu, ɛmɔ annwu Ye, nakoso ɛmɔ dɔ Ye, kesaalae ɛmɔnnwu ye, nakoso ɛmɔdɛ́ ye bɛdi. Na ɛmɔ nye agye paa bɔ ɛmɔdi ahurusi, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />ɛmɔ gyidie ti, ɛmɔ konya ngoa.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔ kra konya ngoa.”</char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Sɔ ngoa ne, adiifoɛ bɔ bɛhyɛle adom bɔ ɛmɔ konya ye nanwo ngɔm ne neɛneane nu yé, na bɛyɛle nhwehwɛmuɛ bɛhɔle siɛ, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bekonwu bɔ ɔkɔto Kristo ne, ɔne mmerɛ bɔ okosisi ne. Ofikyɛ honhom bɔ ɔwɔ bɛ nu ne ha hyirele bɛ kyɛ, né Kristo konwu amaneɛ, na yesi ne, bɛkɔhyɛ ye anuonyam. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Na bɛmaa bɛnwuni<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛyele ye ali behyirele bɛ.”</char></note> kyɛ, ɔsom adwuma bɔ bɛyɛ ne, bɛnyɛ bɛmma bɛ nwo, mmom bɛyɛ bɛma ɛmɔ bɔ kesaalae bɛka sɔ dwirɛ ne bɛkyire ɛmɔ ne. Na yeɛ ole nzɛmba bɔ honhom krongron fili anwuro hane ebiemɔ maa bɛha bɛhyirele ɛmɔ ne. Sɔ nningyein, né abɔfo po pena kyɛ bɛnwu nu.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Yeti ɛmɔsiesie ɛmɔ adwene bɛma adwuma ne, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nye bɛto adom bɔ Yesu Kristo da ye nwo ali a, bɛkɔfa bɛkɔma ɛmɔ naso. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ɛmɔyɛ kyɛ ngwalaa bɔ bɛ so yɛ mmerɛ, na akɔnnɔ bɔ né ɛmɔli ye si mmerɛ bɔ ne ɛmɔnze hwee ne, nnɛmɔ kɔ ye nwo kõ. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Mmom ɛmɔyɛ krongron wɔ nikye biala nu, ofikyɛ Bɔ ɔfrɛle ɛmɔ ne te krongron, <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />na bahworɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔyɛ Krongron, ofikyɛ nde krongron.” <verse eid="1PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Baba bɔ ɛmɔbɔ ye mbaeɛ ne, obu atɛn a ɔnnea sona nyunu, mmom obu ye kyɛbɔ ebiala adwuma te, yeti ɛmɔfa esuronyi bɛbɔ ɛmɔ bra, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ ayɛ ɛwɔfoɛ wɔ wiase ne. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ofikyɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ, abrabɔ tɛɛ bɔ ɛmɔ baba mɔ fa yakyile ɛmɔ ne, nná nningyein bɔ ɔporɔ te kyɛ dwetɛ ne sikaa kɔkorɛ yeɛ ɔfa tɔle ɛmɔ fili nu ɔ, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />mmom Kristo mogya bɔ ɔsom bo ne, boan ba bɔ dɛm ne ngekayɛɛ biala nne ye nwo né mogya. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Bɛyele ye kora yeɛ bɛbaabɔ wiase, nakoso ɛmɔ ti, bɛlale ye ali wɔ awieɛ mmerɛ nanu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Na ɔnate ye so yeɛ ɛmɔdɛ́ Nyameɛ bɛdi ɔ, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ otingyele ye fili ewue nu na ɔhyɛle ye anuonyam kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ konya gyidie ne anidasoɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nu.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Kesaalae, ɛmɔ ayɛ asoɛ bama nahorɛ ne bafa bate ɛmɔ nwo, na wamaa ɛmɔ anya ɔdɔ bɔ nyaatwom nne nu bama ɛmɔ nwo, yeti ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo paa. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ofikyɛ bafa Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte ase daa ne dwirɛ ne bawo ɛmɔ foforɛ, ɛhe de, ɔtte nikye bɔ ɔporɔ ɔ, mmom nikye bɔ ɔmborɔ. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Ná,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Anwoɔnaen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmenia”</char></note> mukoraati te kyɛ ndire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">na b'anuonyam te kyɛ flawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Ndire ne kese, ná flawa ne aporo.<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Nakoso Awurade dwirɛ de, ɔwɔ berɛ daa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Sɔ dwirɛ he yeɛ ole nzɛmba bɔ bɛha behyirele ɛmɔ ne.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Yeti, ɛmɔgyi ɛhemɔ mukoraati bɛgua: bɔne, nnaka-naka, nyaatwom, anyeborolɛ, ɔne dwudwolɛ bɔ ɔttemaye. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Ɛmɔyɛ kyɛ ngwalaa bɔ bawo bɛ foforɛ ne, ná ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye edwirɛ ne bɔ wayɛ kyɛ nyɔfonesue bɔ enu api<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nyɔfonesue bɔ bɛfralle nu.”</char></note> nanwo, na wamaa ɛmɔ anyi bahɔ ngoa nu, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ anwu kyɛ Awurade te pa ne.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Ɛmɔ bra Ye berɛ, ye yeɛ ole ngoa nyɔboɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nyɔboɛ bɔ ngoa wɔ nu”</char></note> bɔ mmenia gyi tole ne, nakoso Nyameɛ fale, ofikyɛ ɔsom bo ma ye. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔte kyɛ ngoa nyɔboɛ bɔ bɛfa ɛmɔ besi honhom nu sua maa ɛmɔyɛ sɔfo kue bɔ ɔte krongron, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kɔfa Yesu Kristo so bɛkɔbɔ afɔleɛ bɔ ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Na Tworɔnzɛm ne ka kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Nea, maye ahameɛ nyɔboɛ titire bie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">na mefa meto Zion;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">ebiala bɔ okonya yenu gyidie ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ye nyunu ngogua ase lle.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔle gyidie ne de, ɔsom bo ma ɛmɔ, nakoso bɛ bɔ belle gyidie ne de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Nyɔboɛ bɔ brekyafoɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmenia bɔ bɛsi sua.”</char></note> ne gyi tole ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ɛhene yeɛ waayɛ nyɔboɛ bɔ ye nwo hia paa ne.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Ɔte</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Nyɔboɛ bɔ ɔto sintidua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">ne nyɔboɛ bɔ ɔmaa bɛfi ase.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Ɔto bɛ sintidua, ofikyɛ bandie edwirɛ ne. Na sɔ ala yeɛ ɔkɔto bɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔte mmenia bɔ baye ɛmɔ, dehyeɛ asɔfo kue, maen krongron, mmenia bɔ Nyameɛ afa ɛmɔ ayɛ ye agyapadeɛ, kyɛ ɛmɔha Bɔ ɔfrɛle ɛmɔ fili awosii nu wale kanea nu né nneyɛɛ pa nanwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Mmerɛ bie, né ɛmɔtte maen, nakoso ɛnɛ, ɛmɔte Nyameɛ maen, mmerɛ bie, né Nyameɛ nnwu ɛmɔ anwunvo, nakoso ɛnɛ, onwu ɛmɔ anwunvo.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Adɔfo, mesrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔte ɛwɔfoɛ ne amanfrafoɛ, yeti ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ nwo, ofikyɛ ɔkõ tia ɛmɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Ɛmɔbɔ bra pa wɔ maen-maen nanu, na sɛ bɛbɔ ɛmɔ sommoɛ kyɛ ɛmɔte nnipa-bɔnefoɛ po a, bekonwu ɛmɔ bra pa ne, ná bali ye nwo adanzeɛ bahyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam, kyẽa bɔ ɔkɔɔnea kyɛbɔ nningyein kɔ ne.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Awurade ti, ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛma sona nhyehyɛɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tumidie.”</char></note> biala; kyɛ ɔte ɔhene bɔ ole tumi, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />anaa bɛ bɔ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Amrado bɔ ɔhene soma bɛ.”</char></note> ɔhene soma bɛ maa bɛkɔtwe abɔnefoɛ so, na bɛkamvo bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ nikye pa ne. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ofikyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔ kɔyɛ nikye pa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ bɛnde dwirɛ bo ne kɔyakyi bɛ ngwasea-keka ne. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ɛmɔlɛ́ fahodie, nakoso, nnɛmɔfa ɛmɔ fahodie ne bɛkata ɛmɔ nyunu bɛyɛ bɔne, mmom ɛmɔfa bɛsõ Nyameɛ kyɛ ye ngoaa. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Ɛmɔfa nidie bɛma sona biala, ɛmɔnya ɔdɔ bɛma aliemaa mɔ mukoraati, ɛmɔsuro Nyameɛ, ɛmɔbu ɔhene.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Ɛmɔma ngoaa brɛ bɛ nwo ase bɛma bɛ wura mɔ, na bɛfa nidie bɛma bɛ. Nná bɛ bɔ bɛte pa na bɛte edwirɛ bo ne ngome yeɛ odikyɛ bɛyɛ bɛma bɛ ɔ, mmom bɛ bɔ bɛ ti anu yɛ se ne koso. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ahonim<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tiboa.”</char></note> pa bɔ ebie le wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu nati, sɛ onwu amaneɛ, anaa bɛtane ye nye na omia ye nye gyina nu a, ɔte pa. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Sɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɔne maa bɛbo ɛmɔ, na ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye begyina nu a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɔwɔ so ɔ? Nakoso, sɛ ɛmɔyɛ nikye pa, na ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye bɛnwu amaneɛ wɔ ye nwo a, ɛhene yeɛ ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye ɔ.<verse eid="1PE 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛfrɛle ɛmɔ ne, ofikyɛ Kristo po nwuni amaneɛ mane ɛmɔ, na ɔfa yɛle nneasoɛ kyɛ ɛmɔli ye gyasi pɛɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />“Wanyɛ bɔne biala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">na bannwu ngondombo biala koso wɔ ye noa nu.”<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛpepɛle ye nzoaa ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">wambɛ bɛ bie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:23">onwu amaneɛ ne, wanwuna-nwuna ebiala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:23">mmom ɔfale ye nwo wurale Bɔ obu atɛn tenenee ne sa.<verse eid="1PE 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Ye bɔbɔ yeɛ ɔfale ye nipadua soale yɛ bɔne wɔ bakaa naso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:24">kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛkɔ yakyi bɔne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:24">na yatena ase yayɛ bɔ ɔtengyɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Né ɛmɔ ayɛ kyɛ mmoan bɔ bamini ne, nakoso kesaalae de, ɛmɔ asa bawa bɔ ɔnea ɛmɔ kra so, na ɔbɔ ɛmɔ nwo waen ne berɛ.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Sɔ ala yeɛ odikyɛ mmrasua bɔ bagya ne brɛ bɛ nwo ase ma bɛ humɔ, na sɛ bandie edwirɛ ne a, ɛmɔ suban pa nati, ɛmɔ konya bɛ, bɔ ɛmɔ ngodwudwo ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Ofikyɛ bɛkɔfa bɛ nye bekonwu ɛmɔ suban pa ne obuo bɔ ɔkɔ siɛ ne. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Nnɛmɔ maa ɛmɔ anwoyemene<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ahosiesie”</char></note> gyina nningyein bɔ anyeɛ nwu ye ne ngome so, te kyɛ tiri bɔ ɛkɔbɔ, agudeɛ bɔ ɛkɛfa kosiesie wɔ nwo, anaa ndadeɛ pa bɔ ekowura. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Mmom, ɛmɔma ogyina nningyein bɔ ɔnzɛkye so, ɛhene yeɛ ole kyɛbɔ sona ne te deinn wɔ ye ahone nu, honhom bɔ odwo na ɔbrɛ ye nwo ase, ɛhene yeɛ ɔsom bo ma Nyameɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ofikyɛ sɔ ala yeɛ tete ne, mmrasua bɔ bɛte krongron ne siesiele bɛ nwo ɔ. Bɛfale bɛ nwo bɛtole Nyameɛ so, na bɛbrɛle bɛ nwo ase bɛmane bɛ humɔ, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />kyɛbɔ Sara tiele Abraham na ɔfrɛle ye me wura ne. Ɛmɔ koso, sɛ ɛmɔkɔ so bɛyɛ nikye pa, na ɛmɔ amma esuronyi anga ɛmɔ a, né ɛmɔte ye mmaa mɔ.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Huɛ mɔ, ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔte mmrasua nemɔ bo,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔ ne bɛ tena wɔ nimdeɛ nu.”</char></note> ɛmɔfa nidie bɛma bɛ, na ɛmɔkaye kyɛ bɛyɛ mmerɛ bɛtra ɛmɔ. Ná ɛmɔ mbaeɛ nwo atee anzi, ofikyɛ ngoa bɔ bafa balo ɛmɔ ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Ngoa adom bɔ bafa bama ɛmɔ ne.”</char></note> bɛ koso bɛboka so.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Afei, ɛmɔ mukoraati, ɛmɔnya adwene kõ, ɛmɔnwu ɛmɔ nwo anwunvo, na ɛmɔnya onuadɔ, ahunu-ndetelɛ, ne anwobraseɛ. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Nnɛmɔfa bɔne betua bɔne so, sɛ ebie pɛ ɛmɔ nzoaa, nnɛmɔpɛ ye bie. Mmom ɛmɔhyira mmenia, ná ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ anya nhyira, ofikyɛ sɔ asetena he ati yeɛ bɛfrɛle ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ná,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Ebiala bɔ okuro ngoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">na ɔpena kyɛ ye nye gye ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">ɔnea yé na wamva ye temverema wanga mmusue dwirɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ɔnea yé na wanlaka-laka mmenia;<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />ɔhwe ye nwo fi bɔne ye nwo, na ɔyɛ pa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">ɔpena asomdwie na oli ye si.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ofikyɛ Awurade nye wɔ ateneneefoɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">na watɛ ye so bɔ otie bɛ mbaeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Nakoso, bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ bɔne ne de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">Awurade nye kyi bɛ.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Sɛ ɛmɔfa besie ɛmɔ nye so kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔyɛ nikye pa a, nwa yeɛ ɔkɔha ɛmɔ ɔ? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Na sɛ tenenee ti ɛmɔnwu amaneɛ a, ɛmɔ nye kɔgye. “Nnɛmɔ maa bɛ nwo suronyi tɔ ɛmɔ so, na nnɛmaa ɛmɔ kunu tete ɛmɔ.” <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Mmom, ɛmɔ ahone nu de, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ Kristo te krongron, na ɔte Awurade. Ɛmɔ boɔboa ɛmɔ nwo besie kyɛ ebiala bɔ okobisa anidasoɛ bɔ ɛmɔle ye nanwo dwirɛ ne, ɛmɔ kɔye ye noa. Nakoso ɛmɔyɛ ye wɔ anwobraseɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Odwo”</char></note> ne nidie nu.<verse eid="1PE 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Ɛmɔnya ahonim pa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ bɛkeka ɛmɔ nwo dwirɛ tɛɛ ne nyunu kogua ase, ɔnate bra pa bɔ Kristo ti, ɛmɔbɔ ne. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Na sɛ Nyameɛ ma atee ma ɛmɔnwu amaneɛ, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ nikye pa a, ɔte pa tra kyɛ ɛmɔkonwu amaneɛ wɔ bɔne nu ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Bɔne ti, Kristo wuli pɛenko, teneneeniɛ wu mane abɔnefoɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, okoli ɛmɔ nyunu kɔhɔ Nyameɛ berɛ. Bɛhuni ye wɔ anwoɔnaen nu, nakoso bɛtingyele ye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛmaa ɔtenane ase”</char></note> honhom nu. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Na sɔ tebea nanu yeɛ ɔɔhane edwirɛ hyirele ahonhom bɔ bɛla prizin ne, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />bɛ yeɛ bɛyɛle asoserɛ wɔ Nowa berɛ so ne. Sɔ mmerɛ ne, Nyameɛ nyane aboterɛ nwondɛle maa Nowa yɛle alaka ne. Na mmenia kaa bie, akra mmɔtwɛ yeɛ benyane ngoa wɔ nzue nanu ɔ.<verse eid="1PE 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Ná ye sɛso bɔ ɛnɛ odɛ́ ɛmɔ ngoa yeɛ ole asubɔ—ɔtte anwoɔnaen nu fiɛ bie yeɛ yɛnwunzi ɔ, mmom yɛsrɛ Nyameɛ kyɛ ɔma yɛ tiboa pa—bɔ ɔnate Yesu Kristo bɔ bɛtingyele ye naso ne. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Ɔhɔle anwuro ne, ɔɔtenane Nyameɛ sa famaa so; na bafa abɔfo, atumvoɛ, ne bɛ bɔ bɛle anwoserɛ mukoraati bawura yebo.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Ɔnate kyɛ Kristo nwuni amaneɛ anwoɔnaen nu nati, ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔnya sɔ adwene nala bie na ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye, ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ wanwu amaneɛ anwoɔnaen nu ne, wahwe ye nwo wafi bɔne nwo, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ye ngyẽa bɔ waha wɔ anwoɔnaen nu ne, ɔngɔtena ase ngɔma sona akɔnnɔ kõ, mmom ɔkɔyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Na mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔfa bɛyɛle nningyein bɔ maen-maen ne kuro ne, ɛhene te pa. Sɔ mmerɛ ne, ɛmɔ fale ɛmɔ nwo bɛwurale ahohwibra, akɔnnɔ bɔne, nzãa bolɛ, paati bɔ yebo gye-gyee-gye, akɔwenzafoɛ fekue, ɔne abosonsom bɔ ɔyɛ tɛ nu. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Ɔnate kyɛ, afei de ɛmɔmva ɛmɔ nwo benwura sɔ bra-bɔne nanu kõ nati, ɔyɛ bɛ nwanwa, na bɛkeka ɛmɔ nwo dwirɛ tɛɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Nakoso sɔ mmenia hemɔ kobu ngondaa kohyire bɔ okobu ateasefoɛ ne awufo mukoraati atɛn ne. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Na ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛhane nzɛmba ne bɛhyirele awufo po ne, na sɛ bɛbu bɛ atɛn anwoɔnaen nu wɔ sona nye so a, Nyameɛ nye so de, honhom ne kohyire b'abrabɔ atee.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Nakoso, nningyein mukoraati awieɛ apingye; yeti ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, na ɛmɔyɛ krado kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔbɔ mbaeɛ daa biala. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Bɔ ɔtra so ne, ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo paa, ofikyɛ ɔdɔ kata bɔne pee so. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Ɛmɔte ɛmɔ nyunu bɛsõ ɛmɔ nwo wɔfoɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Na akyɛdeɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nu biala anya ye ne, ɛmɔfa bɛsõ ɛmɔ nwo, kyɛ ebie bɔ bafa Nyameɛ adom akyɛdeɛ bɔ ɔyɛ adwuma wɔ atee pee so ne bawura ye sa. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Sɛ ebie dwudwo a, ma ɔha ye kyɛ Nyameɛ dwirɛ; sɛ ebie sõ a, ma ɔfa ye nwo to anwoserɛ bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ naso, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, nikye biala nu ne, bɛkɔfa Yesu Kristo so bɛkɔhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam. Ye yeɛ anuonyam ne anwoserɛ te ye deɛ daa, daa. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Adɔfo, nzɔhwɛ bɔ wato ɛmɔ, bɔ wamaa ɛmɔ nwo yerɛ-yera ɛmɔ ne, nnɛmɔ maa ɔyɛ ɛmɔ nwanwa kyɛ ɛnwa nikye foforɛ bie yeɛ wato ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Mmom, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye kyɛ ɛmɔ anwu Kristo amaneɛ ne bie, na sɛ bɛda ye anuonyam ne ali a, ɛmɔ nye agye abo so. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Sɛ Kristo dumaa nati, bɛpepɛ ɛmɔ nzoaa a, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ honhom bɔ ɔte anuonyam honhom ne wɔ ɛmɔ so. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Nakoso, nnɛmaa ɛmɔ nu biala nwu amaneɛ kyɛ wudiniɛ, awieniɛ, nnipa-bɔneniɛ, anaa ebie bɔ ɔfa ye nwo wuro-wura amanvoɛ dwirɛ nu. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Na Kristoniɛ bɔ ɛte nati, sɛ ɛmɔnwu amaneɛ a, ɔnyɛ nyã,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔnyɛ fɛle.”</char></note> mmom ɔhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam kyɛ sɔ dumaa ne la ɛmɔ so ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Mmerɛ aso kyɛ atemmuo hyɛ yebo fi Nyameɛ awuro. Na sɛ bɛfa yɛ bɛhyɛ yebo a, nzaade bɛ bɔ bɛndie Nyameɛ nzɛmba ne, okoyie bɛ sɛ? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Na sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Ɔkɔyɛ se kyɛ bekole teneneeniɛ ngoa a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">ye de, bɔ onzuro Nyameɛ ne, ɔne ɔbɔnefoɛ kogyina nisua?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Ye de, bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ apɛdeɛ ti bɛnwu amaneɛ ne, ma bɛhɔ so bɛyɛ pa, na bɛfa bɛ nwo bɛwura Ɔbɔadeɛ bɔ odi nahorɛ ne sa.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Mbanyi bɔ bɛwɔ ɛmɔ nu ne, me koso nde panyi kyɛ bɛ ala, na nde Kristo amanehunu nanwo adanzeniɛ, afei anuonyam bɔ bɛbaala ye ali ne, ngosa ngonya nu kyɛfa, yeti metu bɛ fo kyɛ: <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Ɛmɔnea Nyameɛ mmoan bɔ bɛwura ɛmɔ sa naso yé, nnɛmɔ maa ɔyɛ kyɛ bɛhyɛ ɛmɔ, mmom ɛmɔfia ɛmɔ kunu bɛyɛ bɛma Nyameɛ; nná adufudeɛ ti ɔ, mmom ɛmɔfa anigye bɛyɛ, <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />nnɛmɔ di Nyameɛ agyapadeɛ naso bakoma,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnɛmɔ hyɛ bɛbɔ bɛwura ɛmɔ sa naso.”</char></note> mmom ɛmɔyɛ nikye pa ma bɛsuesua. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Na sɛ bɛda boan-neafoɛ panyi ne ali a, ɛmɔ konya anuonyam abotire bɔ ɔnzɛkye.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Sɔ ala yeɛ mmrandeɛ koso, ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛma bɛ bɔ bayɛ mbanyi ne. Na ɛmɔ nu biala brɛ ye nwo ase ma ye mmango, ofikyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">“Nyameɛ si bɛ bɔ bɛte dwɛɛ ne atee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">ná anwobraseɛfoɛ de, ɔdo bɛ.”<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛwura Nyameɛ sa bɔ tumi wɔ nu nabo, na mmerɛ bɔ ɔsɛ nu ne, ɔkɔma ɛmɔ so. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Na ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ dadwene mukoraati bɛgua ye so, ofikyɛ ɔdwene ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="1PE 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Ɛmɔbrɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase, na ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ. Ofikyɛ ɛmɔ tamfo Abɔnzam di akɔ-ne-aba te kyɛ gyata bɔ opo, ná ɔpena ebie kye ye ne. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Nakoso ɛmɔgyina berɛ pindinn wɔ gyidie nanu, na ɛmɔ ne ye hõ; ofikyɛ ɛmɔse kyɛ amanehunu komapɛ nala yeɛ ɛmɔ aliema mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ wiase mukoraati ne fa nu ɔ. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Na sɛ ɛmɔnwu amaneɛ kaa a, adom mukoraati Nyameɛ, bɔ ɔnate Kristo so frɛle ɛmɔ wale ye daa anuonyam nu ne kɔmaa ɛmɔ koli mu.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kɔtete ɛmɔ koyie.”</char></note> Ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ bo kotimu, ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔyɛ se. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Ye yeɛ ole tumi daa. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Silas,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Silwano.”</char></note> yeɛ ɔbokale me maa ndworɔle krataa kaa he mmerɛle ɛmɔ ɔ; ɔte aliemaa bɔ mese kyɛ odi nahorɛ paa. Mefa krataa he mehyɛ ɛmɔ nguraen, na me maa ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, ɛhe yeɛ ɔte Nyameɛ adom paa ne. Yeti, ɛmɔgyina nu pindinn.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Brasua bɔ ɔwɔ Babilon, bɔ baye ye kyɛ ɛmɔ ne, yenwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ, na Marko koso nwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1PE 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Ɛmɔfe ɛmɔ noa nwo wɔ ɔdɔ nu bɛfa bɛhyeɛhyea ɛmɔ nwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ wɔ Kristo Yesu nu namukoraati, Asomdwie ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>